      "reason": "Determine how to control residual scale and distinguish the proposal from established recent-item scoring methods.",
      "query": "In SASRec sequential recommendation with tied input/output item embeddings, what established methods combine Transformer features with last-item or recent-item mean embeddings? How do they handle embedding scaling, normalization, learned residual gates, and ablations against longer-history pooling?"
