      "reason": "Resolve implementation details that could introduce leakage or inconsistent inference.",
      "query": "How should causal last-k nonpadding item pooling be implemented for left-padded SASRec next-item training, preserving repeated interactions and excluding future positions? What numerical parity checks verify equivalent per-position training scores, final-position inference scores, and checkpoint-loaded prediction scores?"
