      "reason": "Make the baseline comparison reproducible and limit false improvement claims under the small pinned validation sample.",
      "query": "For comparing two sequential recommenders using HR@10 on 200 validation users in each of four datasets with 99 fixed negative candidates per user, how should paired user-bootstrap intervals for the macro-average, checkpoint selection, and repeated validation comparisons be handled? What uncertainty remains when training uses only one fixed seed?"
